===== The empirical null =====
Control genomes bred and selected alongside everything else: 1024
Best train fitness reached by a CONTROL:  0.095   (control_random vt=0.10)
  that control's holdout min excess Sharpe: -0.803

  The survival threshold X = 0.000 IS PASSABLE BY LUCK at this population and
  generation count: coin-flip entries cleared it. Any survivor whose
  train fitness is at or below 0.095 is not distinguishable from noise,
  and is marked 'below null' above. Raise X, widen the environment set,
  or judge on the holdout columns only.

